      "claim": "Phenylpropanolamine, a small polar oral drug with high assay transfer (0.984), had absolute oral bioavailability 61.9% in healthy volunteers, directly supporting F >=20%.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C38"],
